WEBVTT

00:12:29.121 --> 00:12:32.662
I'm a digital marketing expert and I
really want to work for your company.

00:12:33.204 --> 00:12:38.537
Click here to find out why I basically
turned the entire hiring process around

00:12:38.912 --> 00:12:40.246
and I stopped sending resumes.

00:12:40.871 --> 00:12:42.412
This is so clever. So wait a minute.

00:12:42.829 --> 00:12:46.121
How many people actually followed up
and how many people ignored it?

00:12:46.412 --> 00:12:53.037
I only targeted maybe 12. And I heard from
for the very first follow up I got,

00:12:53.162 --> 00:12:58.246
they said, please stop doing this.
I don't like it because

00:12:59.287 --> 00:13:00.787
they didn't like the fact that you were